{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7dca9495b091ffb4c664fb9cfb9f43df5c34c5a33f6c09b181a04dca2872c1c1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15c5a5a856592e8316eaab28ce64023789af4312b0a1f4f4714c9126aa326227",
      "text": "啊。晚上好，制作人。\n诶嘿嘿，是花音哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9caf4e547c0844864518a5f63bcda931e050fea5124dc6359dc1f80d1c81d985",
      "text": "那个啊，\n睡觉前无论如何都想向你说声谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49091ad6ae41e9e0558310045753bb3bae2db635dd9384a43970b729cdbb8abf",
      "text": "谢谢你今天为我办了这么棒的生日会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5acc3f4fad0317b02c83ff36b702c06eda2ef48a45e2f387636db8c883412c6",
      "text": "比花音想象的还要更～加更～加\n精彩又可爱的大派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d10e2828670ed70e6282ce210d75a6ba1b42267eb2993400b3a2f3f68afddf6",
      "text": "爸爸、妈妈还有妹妹，看了照片之后\n都夸奖说超级棒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b23f70c63b12f5403e5987997865ee2df27b5a79ef373a9cca3d2569ff506081",
      "text": "今天的照片会发到SNS上对吧？\n好想快点让粉丝大家也看到呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa307ba85c8669e7d0cbd4ca29eeddf68a81a58fe886ee75988c195f8dfde75f",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，大家会给出什么样的反应呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:369f3fc31a94753a37f4a6dfc04b595cbc02fe04dfaba5ceaad018bdb92ee081",
      "text": "大家肯定也会\n夸你很可爱的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:261fbc9355b8819c85c3d02d584107d4da65788e52e28bff8d20e6dedbac32e3",
      "text": "会收到很多很多\n留言评论的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57283a6d6768d50c3e5c0cca7f8dd07295cca672dae7ebf8a083659a865d3b3c",
      "text": "说的也是呢♪等照片上传了，\n我也要去告诉直央君他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ddbb161897f17ae2585f25a90089b20d6d64fb555adbe76a24778b3fd273e33",
      "text": "……哈啊。花音到了该睡觉的时间了。\n制作人，今天真的太谢谢你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_22_t01:1_2_034_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc43d148d9c437c28f5671400f53e86aac13ca163af77731be2b84665154ec07",
      "text": "蛋糕的照片传上去了记得告诉我哦！\n那么，晚安啦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
